{"title":"Christmas Popper","slug":"Christmas_Popper","hero":null,"pageid":3630,"revid":17019,"timestamp":"2025-01-25T21:45:42Z","lastEditor":"Responsible Bacon","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay Island"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Santa's Workshop"},{"label":"Price","value":"2,008 Snowflakes"},{"label":"Function","value":"Gambling Machine / Randomized Item Giver"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"Version 1.71.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<p>\"A popper that gives a completely random item, the pricier, the rarer! Can give any store item purchasable with cash.\"\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The Christmas Popper is an item that can be purchased at Santa's Workshop for 2,008 snowflakes during the Christmas event, or can be obtained through the advent calendar at the Christmas tree near <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>. Upon putting it in your inventory and clicked while it is in the hand, it gives a object that can be purchased with cash from shop.\n</p><p>[As the price of that item increases, the chance of getting that item is less likely.]\n</p><p>Below is a table of everything known that the Christmas Popper  can give the player.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/XAND_Gate/\">XAND gate</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: XAND Gate boxed\">XAND Gate boxed</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/14_Segment_Display/\">14 Segment Display</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: 14 Segment Display boxed\">14 Segment Display boxed</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Frequency_Clock/\">Hertz Clock</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\